  Paths stay in the source SVG's coordinate space; the <group> maps the source's 482pt tile onto the
  72dp the launcher shows. Furthest point of the mark then sits 31.1dp from centre — inside the 33dp
  safe radius. Keep that group identical here, in ic_launcher_background and in ic_launcher_monochrome.

  The two #001C16 paths are the source's translate(9 11) shadow copies, kept as separate paths
  because vector drawables have no blur.
-->
